OL,3,GNEWSASafety at hospital A&E
OL,4,A'inadequate', says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafety concerns about corridor care and
OL,7,Fdelays in patient assessment at East
OL,8,FSurrey Hospital have led to a formal
OL,9,Fwarning from a regulator.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) rated
OL,12,Fits emergency department and medical
OL,13,Fcare as "requires improvement", with
OL,14,FA&E safety "inadequate", after a March
OL,15,Finspection.
OL,17,FInspectors found ambulance patients
OL,18,Fwere "seen in order of arrival rather
OL,19,Fthan prioritised" and there was
OL,20,F"limited clinical oversight" of
OL,21,Fpatients waiting for initial
OL,22,Fassessment.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
