OL,3,GNEWSASafety at hospital A&E
OL,4,A'inadequate', says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital bosses accepted the findings
OL,7,Fof the report and said they had "taken
OL,8,Fimmediate and comprehensive action to
OL,9,Faddress the concerns identified".
